WEBVTT

01:14.140 --> 01:19.652
[Meet Yourself]

01:20.040 --> 01:24.592
[Episode 28]

01:25.884 --> 01:29.484
The things that usually can't be
found come out when we move.

01:29.484 --> 01:30.194
Yes.

01:30.194 --> 01:31.964
I can't find them when I want to use them.

01:31.964 --> 01:34.465
Look, a dozen nail clippers.

01:34.794 --> 01:36.524
And the old cell phones.

01:36.524 --> 01:37.554
Look.

01:37.554 --> 01:38.964
These can not be thrown away.

01:38.964 --> 01:40.524
These... What's the use of t?

01:40.524 --> 01:42.354
It's so old.

01:42.354 --> 01:43.834
I tell you, keep it as a souvenir.

01:43.834 --> 01:45.506
Mom, This is now...

01:45.554 --> 01:46.890
come here.

01:47.764 --> 01:50.064
Take a look, if the thing
is useless, throw it away.

01:50.064 --> 01:51.344
Don't ask me.

01:51.524 --> 01:52.354
Wait.

01:52.354 --> 01:54.366
What to throw, let me check.

01:56.684 --> 01:58.068
So much dirt.

01:59.844 --> 02:01.554
It's the fan that grandma bought for me

02:01.554 --> 02:03.234
when I was in elementary school, right?

02:03.234 --> 02:04.414
Why do you still keep this?

02:04.414 --> 02:05.624
It's been over 20 years.

02:05.624 --> 02:06.494
It's already broken.

02:06.494 --> 02:08.690
Dou, it should be thrown away.

02:08.714 --> 02:10.530
Why are you wiping it?

02:11.364 --> 02:13.204
Let me see if it's broken.

02:13.274 --> 02:15.870
Don't try, it must be broken.

02:17.754 --> 02:19.034
Look.

02:21.754 --> 02:23.964
Look, the quality of
previous products is good.

02:23.964 --> 02:25.624
It can still work well.

02:26.524 --> 02:31.034
In order to buy this for her, her
grandma raised more than 30 chickens

02:31.034 --> 02:34.642
and saved the eggs to sell
more than 100 yuan to buy it.

02:47.204 --> 02:48.484
Is it cool?

02:55.524 --> 02:56.524
Enough.

02:56.524 --> 02:58.754
It is too old to the new house.

02:58.754 --> 03:00.034
Don't keep it.

03:00.274 --> 03:01.718
I'll keep it.

03:01.754 --> 03:03.774
It belongs to grandma's wind.

03:04.154 --> 03:05.474
Grandma's wind.

03:05.474 --> 03:08.562
Your grandma would
go crazy if she knew this.

03:08.714 --> 03:10.994
This is our Secretary
Li of Yunmiao Village.

03:10.994 --> 03:12.644
This is the Village Director.

03:12.644 --> 03:15.274
This is the vice president
of our group, Ms. Wang.

03:15.274 --> 03:15.754
Ms. Wang.

03:15.754 --> 03:16.204
Hello.

03:16.204 --> 03:17.484
Welcome.

03:17.594 --> 03:18.404
Hello, Ms. Wang.

03:18.404 --> 03:19.274
Hello.

03:19.274 --> 03:22.174
This is our group's Deputy
Director, Manager Xu.

03:22.174 --> 03:23.034
Hello, Manager Xu.

03:23.034 --> 03:23.874
Manager Xu.

03:23.874 --> 03:24.554
Yao.

03:24.554 --> 03:25.524
Liu.

03:25.524 --> 03:26.874
It's been a long time.

03:26.874 --> 03:28.434
It's been a long time.

03:28.434 --> 03:30.094
Mr. Xie, we meet again.

03:30.404 --> 03:32.250
Why haven't I seen Hongdou?

03:32.274 --> 03:33.994
She's not here.

03:35.594 --> 03:36.874
Where is she?

03:37.684 --> 03:40.244
Look, he only remembers beautiful women.

03:40.244 --> 03:43.124
Yao, today, let me formally
introduce him to you.

03:43.124 --> 03:49.356
In fact, Zhang is our chief
designer, and one of our partners.

03:49.404 --> 03:51.124
Chief designer, partner.

03:51.124 --> 03:52.104
So young.

03:52.104 --> 03:54.275
Last time, I came with
Liu and his wife to play,

03:54.275 --> 03:57.094
I was afraid of causing you
trouble, so I said I was an assistant.

03:57.094 --> 03:57.924
So sweet.

03:57.924 --> 03:59.034
No trouble.

03:59.034 --> 04:01.694
Yao, I've introduced chief
designer Zhang to you.

04:01.694 --> 04:04.874
Later, I'll introduce all
the team members to you.

04:04.874 --> 04:05.964
Great!

04:05.964 --> 04:08.754
Today, it's mainly the village's
arrangement, so I'll cooperate.

04:08.754 --> 04:09.714
Okay.

04:09.714 --> 04:11.204
Xinxin.

04:11.204 --> 04:12.274
Come on, Secretary Li.

04:12.274 --> 04:13.274
Let me introduce.

04:13.274 --> 04:14.554
Mr. Liu.

04:20.984 --> 04:23.844
[Real-time reporting. Here they are.]

04:23.844 --> 04:26.484
♫ Stars in the sky ♫

04:26.484 --> 04:29.164
♫ I pick some mushrooms ♫

04:29.164 --> 04:31.844
♫ Mushrooms can fill the basket ♫

04:31.844 --> 04:34.804
♫ I take out a pen ♫

04:34.804 --> 04:36.804
[Go ahead. Good luck.]

04:36.804 --> 04:37.724
♫ The pen leaks ink ♫

04:37.724 --> 04:40.644
♫ What can I do? ♫

04:40.644 --> 04:45.964
♫ I have piles of mung beans ♫

04:48.844 --> 04:51.744
♫ Mung beans are delicious ♫

04:51.744 --> 04:54.604
♫ Gingers are tender ♫

04:54.604 --> 04:57.564
♫ Tender gingers taste pungent ♫

04:57.564 --> 04:59.274
We'll be right over to have dinner.

04:59.274 --> 05:00.910
You can start now.

05:01.064 --> 05:03.980
Especially your sour papaya
fish, and braised chicken.

05:04.004 --> 05:05.844
Okay, thank you, Aunt Hua.

05:07.154 --> 05:10.734
Mr. Xie, I just heard Zhang say
that they have to go back to discuss.

05:10.734 --> 05:11.914
Is that a tactic?

05:11.914 --> 05:12.464
No.

05:12.464 --> 05:14.084
They should have a meeting.

05:14.084 --> 05:15.084
Take it easy.

05:15.084 --> 05:16.714
I think we can make it this time.

05:16.714 --> 05:19.954
♫ With a slim figure ♫

05:19.954 --> 05:25.594
♫ My baby, let's go to sleep ♫

05:25.594 --> 05:26.884
Qiu.

05:26.884 --> 05:27.474
Yes.

05:27.474 --> 05:31.034
When I was traveling in
Yunnan, it's the village I stayed in.

05:31.034 --> 05:34.233
Now that homestay has been built.

05:34.234 --> 05:36.794
And that village is also in development.

05:36.794 --> 05:41.258
If the owner hadn't been sick,
it would not have been sold out.

05:41.274 --> 05:44.644
I think that your homestays
are doing quite well.

05:44.644 --> 05:47.204
I just want to ask if you're
considering opening a branch.

05:47.204 --> 05:49.844
Hongdou, why don't you buy it?

05:49.844 --> 05:54.034
Working in the hotel
for others day and night,

05:54.034 --> 05:55.564
it's better to work for yourself.

05:55.564 --> 05:57.860
I really have not considered this.

05:57.884 --> 05:59.664
Didn't you quit your job?

05:59.884 --> 06:01.484
Is there a better job?

06:01.884 --> 06:06.090
A friend of mine invited me to a
hotel's staff training department.

06:06.114 --> 06:08.807
The salary is lower
than in the front hall.

06:08.884 --> 06:09.155
Yes.

06:09.155 --> 06:11.720
The benefit is the normal working hours.

06:11.744 --> 06:14.154
I'm not really thinking
about starting a business.

06:14.154 --> 06:17.902
After all, starting a business
needs a lot of money, right?

06:18.884 --> 06:20.394
You're right to think so.

06:20.394 --> 06:23.114
It is safe to work for
others and get paid.

06:23.114 --> 06:25.554
Starting a business is indeed risky.

06:46.504 --> 06:47.984
[Sleeping?]

06:48.504 --> 06:49.984
[No.]

06:55.504 --> 06:58.004
[Alone in your room?]

06:58.004 --> 07:00.684
[Yes.]

07:06.404 --> 07:07.444
Hello.

07:07.444 --> 07:08.274
You're still awake?

07:08.274 --> 07:09.354
Not tired?

07:09.354 --> 07:10.634
Tired.

07:11.204 --> 07:12.714
I've been busy all day.

07:12.714 --> 07:15.154
My legs are restless. I can't sleep.

07:15.444 --> 07:16.564
What are you doing?

07:16.564 --> 07:17.844
Packing.

07:18.474 --> 07:20.494
Don't think so much about it.

07:21.204 --> 07:22.674
You've done all you can do.

07:22.674 --> 07:26.278
No matter what the
result, you have tried hard.

07:28.444 --> 07:31.124
Mr. Ma's recent moments signature,

07:31.354 --> 07:33.604
do good things, don't
ask about the future.

07:33.604 --> 07:36.470
♫ I'm searching for ♫

07:36.470 --> 07:39.864
♫ A meadow of mine ♫

07:39.864 --> 07:48.264
♫ Till you came in with the breeze ♫

07:53.444 --> 07:54.724
Listen.

07:58.674 --> 07:59.954
What?

08:00.274 --> 08:01.474
The wind is blowing.

08:01.474 --> 08:02.894
What a strong wind.

08:04.254 --> 08:07.154
♫ A feeling rushes over me ♫

08:07.154 --> 08:11.793
♫ Spills my heart into the field ♫

08:11.794 --> 08:13.178
I seem to hear it.

08:14.964 --> 08:16.984
How's the weather over there?

08:17.084 --> 08:18.364
It's good.

08:19.674 --> 08:20.954
It's raining.

08:22.354 --> 08:23.764
Dou, it's raining.

08:23.764 --> 08:25.404
There are quilts drying on the rooftop.

08:25.404 --> 08:26.804
Come with me to collect them.

08:26.804 --> 08:28.476
Okay, Mom, right away.

08:29.434 --> 08:31.514
Your mother is talking to you?

08:32.564 --> 08:35.020
Who are you talking to on the phone?

08:35.044 --> 08:36.394
Someone else.

08:36.394 --> 08:37.085
Right away.

08:37.085 --> 08:37.924
Hurry up.

08:37.924 --> 08:38.994
I'm going to hang up.

08:38.994 --> 08:39.834
I'll call you later.

08:39.834 --> 08:47.534
♫ We close our eyes to feel ♫

08:47.534 --> 08:50.214
♫ And smile ♫

09:00.204 --> 09:03.660
♫ Even if fall into the horizon ♫

09:03.684 --> 09:06.714
♫ I want to bloom in the land ♫

09:06.714 --> 09:09.844
♫ The smallest dust ♫

09:09.844 --> 09:14.090
♫ can be favored by you ♫

09:14.114 --> 09:16.650
You sing so well.

09:18.564 --> 09:22.514
♫ Just like a match ♫

09:22.514 --> 09:26.114
♫ can light up a sea of fire ♫

09:26.114 --> 09:26.964
Manjun, slow down.

09:26.964 --> 09:27.715
I'm riding.

09:27.715 --> 09:29.924
♫ Chase the future ♫

09:29.924 --> 09:31.564
♫ Never return ♫

09:31.564 --> 09:33.114
Manjun, you can be happy.

09:33.114 --> 09:34.164
But we have to be safe.

09:34.164 --> 09:37.284
♫ Waiting to fly on the stage ♫

09:37.284 --> 09:41.204
♫ Let the light prove the existence ♫

09:41.204 --> 09:44.354
♫ Even the smallest dust ♫

09:44.354 --> 09:45.684
♫ can be... ♫

09:45.684 --> 09:47.404
Manjun, don't tickle me.

09:47.474 --> 09:48.754
Don't do that.

09:54.754 --> 09:56.034
Manjun.

09:56.594 --> 09:57.874
Manjun.

10:00.564 --> 10:01.804
Are you okay?

10:01.804 --> 10:03.084
Are you okay?

10:04.204 --> 10:05.474
What's wrong?

10:05.474 --> 10:08.442
You fell on your head?

10:12.164 --> 10:12.755
Are you fine?

10:12.755 --> 10:15.924
♫ Even if fall into the horizon ♫

10:15.924 --> 10:17.084
♫ I want to ♫

10:17.084 --> 10:17.805
Still singing?

10:17.805 --> 10:20.284
♫ bloom in the land ♫

10:20.284 --> 10:24.220
♫ If the fire inside is not extinguished ♫

10:24.220 --> 10:28.309
♫ It is not a failure to be bruised ♫

10:28.964 --> 10:32.874
♫ If dream is a sin ♫

10:32.874 --> 10:37.044
♫ I'll spend my life with it ♫

10:37.044 --> 10:38.924
♫ No Regrets ♫

10:38.924 --> 10:42.804
♫ No Regrets ♫

10:44.874 --> 10:49.354
♫ Waiting to fly on the stage ♫

10:49.354 --> 10:54.030
♫ Let the light prove the existence ♫

10:54.030 --> 10:58.551
♫ The smallest dust ♫

10:58.804 --> 11:02.045
Hu rode the scooter with
Manjun, and accidentally

11:02.045 --> 11:03.572
fell into the field.

11:03.634 --> 11:06.710
Does Manjun like Hu?

11:07.634 --> 11:08.514
No way.

11:08.514 --> 11:10.940
Manjun's daughter is now in college.

11:10.964 --> 11:13.874
She has such a big daughter?

11:13.874 --> 11:16.122
It's hard to tell.

11:16.204 --> 11:18.874
She said that not to
interfere with her child,

11:18.874 --> 11:22.250
after the college entrance
exams, she filed for divorce.

11:22.564 --> 11:26.234
But is there any conflict
between her daughter's in college

11:26.234 --> 11:28.146
and her love for Hu?

11:29.284 --> 11:30.704
No.

11:30.964 --> 11:35.110
But at first glance, Hu
is poor, ugly and greasy.

11:35.134 --> 11:37.084
Manjun is rich, beautiful and elegant.

11:37.084 --> 11:38.744
No one thinks that way.

11:38.994 --> 11:42.790
It's not like Hongdou and
Mr. Xie, who look so harmonious.

11:43.164 --> 11:44.444
Harmonious?

11:45.114 --> 11:46.394
Get married.

11:46.474 --> 11:47.874
Stop.

11:47.874 --> 11:50.362
They've ended in tragedy.

11:51.634 --> 11:54.026
I don't like this ending.

11:55.714 --> 11:58.394
If readers ask you to change the ending,

11:58.844 --> 12:00.264
will you change it?

12:00.924 --> 12:02.204
She won't.

12:03.444 --> 12:04.724
Will you?

12:07.234 --> 12:08.844
Dou, the moving van is here.

12:08.844 --> 12:09.285
Come on.

12:09.285 --> 12:10.354
Let's go.

12:10.354 --> 12:11.484
Okay.

12:11.484 --> 12:12.474
The moving van is here.

12:12.474 --> 12:13.444
No more talking.

12:13.444 --> 12:14.194
I'm hanging up.

12:14.194 --> 12:14.685
Bye bye.

12:14.685 --> 12:15.964
Good luck with the move.

12:15.964 --> 12:16.565
Okay, bye-bye.

12:16.565 --> 12:18.084
Good luck with the move.

12:18.084 --> 12:19.364
Bye bye.

12:25.514 --> 12:26.794
3.52 meters.

12:30.754 --> 12:31.394
3.77 meters.

12:31.394 --> 12:32.334
3.42.

12:32.334 --> 12:34.834
In the original design, how
could you waste so much space

12:34.834 --> 12:36.114
to make a yard?

12:36.714 --> 12:37.994
Is it a waste?

12:38.284 --> 12:39.584
I don't think so.

12:40.994 --> 12:42.726
We can add a layer here.

12:43.634 --> 12:44.614
No.

12:44.614 --> 12:45.554
No?

12:45.554 --> 12:47.584
There's a rule that it
can only be so high.

12:47.584 --> 12:49.535
The facade of the
building can't be changed,

12:49.535 --> 12:51.164
and must be unified with the residence.

12:51.164 --> 12:53.834
Ji, look at this place,
can it be turned into

12:53.834 --> 12:56.614
a terrace to make a coffee bar,
and they can have a party at night.

12:56.614 --> 12:58.144
No party at night.

12:58.144 --> 13:00.354
This place shouldn't
be noisy after 8:30 p.m.

13:00.354 --> 13:02.794
It can't affect the residents' rest.

13:06.434 --> 13:07.634
This place is backward.

13:07.634 --> 13:09.204
And there are many troubles.

13:09.204 --> 13:10.084
So many rules.

13:10.084 --> 13:12.334
The original boss said the
capital chain was broken,

13:12.334 --> 13:13.504
which is probably an excuse.

13:13.504 --> 13:16.114
Seeing the situation is
bad, looking for a takeover.

13:16.114 --> 13:16.844
Yes.

13:16.844 --> 13:19.090
The countryside is the countryside.

13:19.114 --> 13:21.362
This land can't be taken over.

13:46.164 --> 13:48.412
Whose spoiled brat?

13:50.044 --> 13:51.324
Brother?

13:54.284 --> 13:56.364
Why are you hitting the glass?

13:58.084 --> 13:59.364
Play.

13:59.564 --> 14:00.844
Play?

14:01.564 --> 14:04.424
I'll go... go home to... cook.

15:17.394 --> 15:18.284
Which one is better?

15:18.284 --> 15:19.848
Help me choose.

15:21.034 --> 15:22.334
They're all fine.

15:27.444 --> 15:28.864
Here you are again.

15:29.234 --> 15:31.204
Can't live without your phone, right?

15:31.204 --> 15:33.836
Are you so bored to go shopping with me?

15:33.874 --> 15:35.498
Just swipe.

15:36.634 --> 15:37.684
Fine.

15:37.684 --> 15:39.154
Anyway, we have moved.

15:39.154 --> 15:42.234
If you need to go back to
Beijing, hurry back to Beijing.

15:42.234 --> 15:45.020
These days, I'm tired of watching you.

15:45.044 --> 15:48.450
I promised Kexin to be
her baby's birth mother.

15:48.474 --> 15:50.164
Isn't she due next month?

15:50.164 --> 15:50.595
Yes.

15:50.595 --> 15:51.714
Yes?

15:51.714 --> 15:53.494
That's still a long time.

15:54.594 --> 15:57.814
Isn't it nice to stay
with you for a few days?

15:59.994 --> 16:04.223
Tell me are you not
satisfied with your current job?

16:05.234 --> 16:06.754
I'm okay.

16:06.754 --> 16:09.410
I work 9 a.m. to 5 p.m.,
and the pay is okay.

16:09.994 --> 16:12.234
I think you're getting lazy.

16:12.234 --> 16:14.446
It's so hard to find a job now.

16:14.474 --> 16:16.234
You have to be positive.

16:16.234 --> 16:19.407
If I were a boss, I wouldn't
hire someone like you.

16:20.164 --> 16:21.594
We don't usually see each other.

16:21.594 --> 16:24.982
I've been back for several
days, and you're tired of me.

16:25.564 --> 16:28.244
People shouldn't stay idle all the time.

16:30.234 --> 16:31.634
Dad said the same thing.

16:31.634 --> 16:33.354
He? He shouldn't think so.

16:33.354 --> 16:35.394
With his lumbar disc,
what else can he do?

16:35.394 --> 16:38.654
He intends to be so tired
that he can't get up, right?

16:38.654 --> 16:41.094
Running that small supermarket,
and wanting to be a boss,

16:41.094 --> 16:42.514
he's dreaming.

16:49.594 --> 16:50.874
Watch out.

16:52.594 --> 16:54.204
Why buy so much toilet paper?

16:54.204 --> 16:56.634
People who don't know may
think we have a lot of asses

16:56.634 --> 16:57.494
waiting to be wiped.

16:57.494 --> 16:58.434
Where is your mother?

16:58.434 --> 17:01.354
She went to the 8th building to
see the neighbor's decoration.

17:01.354 --> 17:02.750
What neighbor?

17:03.594 --> 17:06.114
High school classmate, who
also bought a house here.

17:06.114 --> 17:07.394
Which classmate?

17:07.394 --> 17:08.694
Li Yulin,

17:08.804 --> 17:10.804
we sat at the front and back tables.

17:10.804 --> 17:12.394
I didn't hear you say that.

17:12.394 --> 17:14.004
I thought she was noisy.

17:14.004 --> 17:16.044
Right, you have a delivery from Yunnan.

17:16.044 --> 17:18.244
The sender's surname is Xie.

17:18.244 --> 17:19.524
Xie Zhiyao.

17:19.804 --> 17:20.954
Who is he?

17:20.954 --> 17:22.434
Yunnan village hunk.

17:30.674 --> 17:32.058
What is this?

17:34.874 --> 17:35.564
Plums.

17:35.564 --> 17:36.844
So many plums.

17:36.844 --> 17:37.914
Two boxes.

17:37.914 --> 17:39.394
This... When can we finish them?

17:39.394 --> 17:40.674
This.

17:44.844 --> 17:47.104
Give plums in return for peaches?

17:48.154 --> 17:49.394
He is solicitous.

17:49.394 --> 17:51.284
Return the plum to the peach.

17:51.284 --> 17:53.044
Homophony is in fashion now.

17:53.044 --> 17:53.704
All right.

17:53.704 --> 17:54.914
Let's move to the kitchen.

17:54.914 --> 17:56.194
Come on.

18:01.764 --> 18:02.564
Come on.

18:02.564 --> 18:04.284
I'll get you some water.

18:09.914 --> 18:11.194
Thank you.

18:12.634 --> 18:13.934
Make room for me.

18:14.114 --> 18:14.764
You are here.

18:14.764 --> 18:16.044
Sister.

18:17.224 --> 18:18.764
By the way, brother,

18:19.194 --> 18:20.194
it's for mouth ulcers.

18:20.194 --> 18:21.564
Put it on and you'll be fine.

18:21.564 --> 18:22.354
Great.

18:22.354 --> 18:23.524
You're sweet.

18:23.524 --> 18:26.684
I'm not the flower of the horse farm
for nothing.

18:26.954 --> 18:28.914
Okay, let's have a meeting.

18:29.114 --> 18:33.114
I'll start with the third quarter
development plan of the horse farm.

18:33.114 --> 18:35.074
There are three main points.

18:58.114 --> 18:58.724
Okay.

18:58.724 --> 19:00.434
That's all for today's meeting.

19:00.434 --> 19:01.084
Go back.

19:01.084 --> 19:02.194
Okay.

19:02.194 --> 19:03.674
Ms. Chun, is there anything else?

19:03.674 --> 19:04.484
No.

19:04.484 --> 19:05.644
Leave first.

19:05.644 --> 19:06.494
Then we're leaving.

19:06.494 --> 19:08.394
Just go. Don't wait for me.

19:09.634 --> 19:11.294
Brother, we're leaving.

19:11.764 --> 19:12.844
We're leaving.

19:12.844 --> 19:13.354
Take care.

19:13.354 --> 19:14.634
Bye bye.

19:17.564 --> 19:18.674
What's up?

19:18.674 --> 19:20.274
What else do you want?

19:22.524 --> 19:23.804
Brother,

19:23.874 --> 19:26.614
have you been under
a lot of stress lately?

19:28.484 --> 19:30.252
I'm fine.

19:30.524 --> 19:32.628
Your face is so dark.

19:32.954 --> 19:36.786
Is there something
wrong with the bookstore?

19:36.914 --> 19:38.394
Not really.

19:39.244 --> 19:43.563
It's just... I thought
things were going well,

19:43.564 --> 19:45.284
but now there's no news.

19:45.564 --> 19:46.674
It is still in suspense.

19:46.674 --> 19:47.954
So I'm worried.

19:48.394 --> 19:52.718
And we haven't resold
the homestay successfully.

19:54.044 --> 19:57.220
In fact, this matter

19:57.244 --> 19:58.594
has nothing to do with us.

19:58.594 --> 20:00.084
You're just there to help.

20:00.084 --> 20:01.804
Just do what you can.

20:02.244 --> 20:03.850
Xiaochun,

20:03.874 --> 20:07.844
take a longer view,
and open up your vision.

20:07.844 --> 20:10.584
This is not a problem that can
be solved by opening my vision.

20:10.584 --> 20:11.954
I don't want you to be anxious.

20:11.954 --> 20:13.494
I know.

20:13.564 --> 20:14.888
Go back.

20:16.314 --> 20:17.594
I'm leaving.

20:30.564 --> 20:31.844
Brother,

20:32.634 --> 20:35.447
have you read Xu
Hongdou's WeChat Moments?

20:35.564 --> 20:36.844
What's wrong?

20:55.594 --> 20:57.254
Is there anything else?

20:57.284 --> 20:58.564
No.

20:58.844 --> 20:59.635
Go back.

20:59.635 --> 21:01.355
Hulu is waiting for you.

21:01.874 --> 21:02.874
Okay.

21:02.874 --> 21:04.318
I'm leaving.

21:05.394 --> 21:06.814
I'm really leaving.

21:09.394 --> 21:10.694
Bye bye.

21:24.644 --> 21:26.644
[The plums are just picked, and sour. ]

21:26.644 --> 21:28.644
[It doesn't go bad easily.
Eat it later.]

21:28.644 --> 21:30.644
[You sent too much.]

21:30.644 --> 21:36.924
[My Dad said you killed the plum seller.]

21:43.144 --> 21:46.144
[I ran so far,
of course, I have to pick more at a time.]

21:46.144 --> 21:48.824
[Thanks for your hard work.]

21:49.144 --> 21:50.624
[Thank you.]

21:51.924 --> 21:53.668
[Hahaha.]

22:27.564 --> 22:29.236
Very comfortable.

22:30.084 --> 22:34.193
Look, here, here, there are
nodules, which are blocked.

22:34.194 --> 22:36.594
That's why you feel pain
in your back all the time.

22:36.594 --> 22:38.494
They should be rubbed open.

22:39.954 --> 22:43.944
I tell you there are also people
in our village who can massage.

22:43.944 --> 22:46.394
Their technique is nothing
compared with yours.

22:46.394 --> 22:48.450
How come you know everything?

22:49.154 --> 22:51.434
My ex-husband had a bad cervical spine,

22:51.434 --> 22:53.754
so I went to learn from a masseur.

22:54.434 --> 22:57.070
You're good, good.

22:59.344 --> 23:00.594
Hold on a little longer.

23:00.594 --> 23:01.874
Okay.

23:02.634 --> 23:04.114
I'm back.

23:04.194 --> 23:05.594
Huang is back.

23:05.594 --> 23:06.724
I'm back.

23:06.724 --> 23:08.588
You are slouching.

23:08.634 --> 23:09.674
I'm not feeling well.

23:09.674 --> 23:10.944
I've got a cold.

23:10.944 --> 23:12.084
Did you take any medicine?

23:12.084 --> 23:12.914
Yes.

23:12.914 --> 23:13.625
Have fun.

23:13.625 --> 23:14.634
I'm going back to rest.

23:14.634 --> 23:15.914
Go to bed early.

23:15.914 --> 23:16.524
Bye bye.

23:16.524 --> 23:17.804
Bye.

23:22.874 --> 23:24.846
What's wrong with Huang?

23:25.004 --> 23:28.564
She hasn't eaten much
these days, she's getting sick.

23:28.564 --> 23:30.114
Is something wrong in our village?

23:30.114 --> 23:31.374
No.

23:31.374 --> 23:34.804
If something happened in the
village, would I not know about it?

23:34.804 --> 23:35.524
Then it's good.

23:35.524 --> 23:36.724
It's good.

23:36.724 --> 23:39.634
But these days Yao has
also been acting strange.

23:39.634 --> 23:43.650
When I see him on the road, and
call him, but he doesn't hear me.

23:43.674 --> 23:45.284
The bookstore is in suspense.

23:45.284 --> 23:48.004
The homestay has not
been resold properly.

23:48.004 --> 23:50.084
They are both under a lot of pressure.

23:50.084 --> 23:53.292
Mr. Xie's mouth ulcers
are really bad these days.

23:53.994 --> 23:56.244
When people are stressed and in bad mood,

23:56.244 --> 23:58.114
they tend to have health problems.

23:58.114 --> 24:01.034
Before the college entrance
examination, my daughter had a low fever

24:01.034 --> 24:01.764
for half a month.

24:01.764 --> 24:03.844
We went to the hospital, and
couldn't find anything wrong.

24:03.844 --> 24:06.525
As a result, she
recovered after the exam.

24:06.914 --> 24:08.634
Looks like she did well.

24:09.154 --> 24:10.004
How's that?

24:10.004 --> 24:10.675
Feel better now?

24:10.675 --> 24:11.764
So comfortable.

24:11.764 --> 24:13.136
So comfortable.

24:13.634 --> 24:14.484
I'm fine.

24:14.484 --> 24:15.634
Thank you.

24:15.634 --> 24:16.355
Thank you, Bai.

24:16.355 --> 24:17.702
You're welcome.

24:17.844 --> 24:19.724
Yu, give me your hand.

24:19.724 --> 24:20.234
Okay.

24:20.234 --> 24:21.914
What happened to your hand?

24:21.914 --> 24:23.004
From playing the guitar.

24:23.004 --> 24:24.154
Tenosynovitis.

24:24.154 --> 24:25.244
Be gentle.

24:25.244 --> 24:26.564
I don't use much strength.

24:26.564 --> 24:27.394
Okay.

24:27.394 --> 24:28.434
You guys play.

24:28.434 --> 24:29.714
I'm leaving.

24:29.844 --> 24:30.525
Bye, Aunt Gui.

24:30.525 --> 24:31.484
Bye, Aunt.

24:31.484 --> 24:32.844
Thank you, Bai.

24:32.844 --> 24:33.484
You're welcome.

24:33.484 --> 24:34.354
Bye.

24:34.354 --> 24:35.564
Gently, sister.

24:35.564 --> 24:37.244
I don't use much strength.

24:37.244 --> 24:39.084
Relax.

24:39.084 --> 24:40.154
Relax.

24:40.154 --> 24:41.634
Big boy.

24:42.244 --> 24:42.844
Relax.

24:42.844 --> 24:44.124
Relax.

24:55.404 --> 24:56.484
It doesn't hurt, does it?

24:56.484 --> 24:57.764
Yes.

24:58.204 --> 25:00.044
♫ Do you ever feel alone ♫

25:00.634 --> 25:01.674
Okay. I'm fine.

25:01.674 --> 25:03.214
Okay. Fine?

25:03.464 --> 25:06.720
♫ Don't know where to go ♫

25:08.264 --> 25:11.644
♫ In the air my memories flow ♫

25:11.644 --> 25:13.644
♫ Faces in a row ♫

25:13.644 --> 25:17.524
♫ Take a long way home ♫

25:17.644 --> 25:24.444
♫ But all of these remind me to believe ♫

25:24.444 --> 25:28.320
♫ No one will stay or leave ♫

25:28.344 --> 25:35.383
♫ And then all of these
remind me to receive ♫

25:35.384 --> 25:38.304
♫ Life we can see ♫

25:38.844 --> 25:44.164
♫ La la la la la la la la la ♫

25:44.644 --> 25:49.720
♫ The sun will rise and fall ♫

25:49.744 --> 25:54.844
♫ La la la la la la la la la ♫

25:54.844 --> 26:00.620
♫ It's just another day ♫

26:00.644 --> 26:06.144
♫ La la la la la la la la la ♫

26:06.144 --> 26:11.244
♫ The sun will rise and fall ♫

26:11.244 --> 26:16.844
♫ La la la la la la la la la ♫

26:16.844 --> 26:22.420
♫ It's just another day ♫

26:22.444 --> 26:27.344
♫ La la la la la la la la la ♫

26:27.344 --> 26:32.204
♫ The sun will rise and fall ♫

26:32.204 --> 26:38.244
♫ La la la la la la la la la ♫

26:38.244 --> 26:44.524
♫ It's just another day ♫

26:46.634 --> 26:49.194
Plums, sent by friends
from Yunnan, a little sour.

26:49.194 --> 26:50.114
Try one.

26:50.114 --> 26:51.394
Thank you.

26:53.284 --> 26:54.564
Sister,

26:55.434 --> 26:56.714
is this one?

26:58.524 --> 26:59.804
Handsome?

27:00.594 --> 27:01.874
Yes.

27:03.394 --> 27:04.826
It's just a pity.

27:05.044 --> 27:06.644
Why?

27:06.644 --> 27:08.944
It's a pity that you met
when you went out to play.

27:08.944 --> 27:11.024
You are not in the same place.

27:15.284 --> 27:16.944
Look at this promo,

27:17.084 --> 27:20.088
do you feel like going to play?

27:20.244 --> 27:21.484
Yes.

27:21.484 --> 27:22.904
I feel pretty good.

27:22.954 --> 27:24.314
What attracts you?

27:25.564 --> 27:29.648
The environment and the atmosphere
of the people are very relaxing.

27:30.844 --> 27:32.124
I think so, too.

27:33.354 --> 27:35.374
It's a very quaint place.

27:36.084 --> 27:39.394
It has the original green
water and mountains.

27:39.394 --> 27:41.606
Time passes very slowly there.

27:42.044 --> 27:44.004
It gives me the feeling that

27:44.394 --> 27:48.610
when we were kids, we
lived in grandma's house.

27:49.044 --> 27:51.100
There are many white clouds,

27:51.284 --> 27:52.564
and

27:53.524 --> 27:55.184
fresh air,

27:55.674 --> 27:57.262
bright sunshine,

27:57.764 --> 28:00.264
and extremely luxurious good weather.

28:02.764 --> 28:06.380
It's a completely different
kind of life than here.

28:06.724 --> 28:09.514
In that small place, a
fixed group of people

28:09.514 --> 28:11.654
live with each other every day.

28:14.004 --> 28:15.580
You can see others

28:16.844 --> 28:18.516
as well as yourself.

28:19.484 --> 28:22.104
And you can feel the essence of life.

28:22.764 --> 28:28.096
It's not about living in a big
house or driving a nice car.

28:28.724 --> 28:35.004
It's about being able to chat
with friends in the sun after dinner.

28:45.724 --> 28:48.874
The reason why we work hard
is to have a better life after work,

28:48.874 --> 28:50.846
isn't it?

28:51.844 --> 28:53.456
I look forward to it.

28:54.914 --> 28:59.766
In my current situation, don't
know when I can go out to play.

28:59.914 --> 29:02.044
Before I got married, I
went out with my friends

29:02.044 --> 29:03.704
every year to have fun.

29:03.844 --> 29:06.394
At that time, Nanxing was able to give us

29:06.394 --> 29:08.534
the internal staff family rate.

29:09.244 --> 29:10.568
In a flash,

29:10.914 --> 29:12.214
I'm a mother now.

29:14.674 --> 29:17.294
Nanxing also died more than a year ago.

29:17.564 --> 29:18.564
So fast.

29:18.564 --> 29:19.924
It's like a dream.

29:21.874 --> 29:25.218
Like flipping through a
book, page after page,

29:25.524 --> 29:26.956
page after page.

29:29.954 --> 29:31.234
Coming.

29:31.844 --> 29:32.914
Who is it?

29:32.914 --> 29:34.084
Aunt, it's me.

29:34.084 --> 29:34.875
Yulin.

29:34.875 --> 29:35.954
Here's a pumpkin for you.

29:35.954 --> 29:37.524
My mother sent it from my hometown.

29:37.524 --> 29:38.354
It's organic.

29:38.354 --> 29:39.004
Very good.

29:39.004 --> 29:39.724
Who is it?

29:39.724 --> 29:40.564
You're very kind.

29:40.564 --> 29:42.634
Yesterday, when I was
shopping in the supermarket,

29:42.634 --> 29:44.944
I met a high school friend
who lives in Building 8

29:44.944 --> 29:46.394
and sells insurance.

29:46.394 --> 29:47.674
Great.

29:48.354 --> 29:49.634
You boy.

29:51.244 --> 29:53.195
It's good for little boys to be naughty.

29:53.195 --> 29:54.795
Where's Hongdou, Aunt?

29:54.984 --> 29:55.874
Her cousin is here.

29:55.874 --> 29:57.094
They're chatting in the room.

29:57.094 --> 29:59.090
I'll go say hello.

29:59.444 --> 30:00.624
I still have work at home.

30:00.624 --> 30:01.284
Don't go back.

30:01.284 --> 30:01.915
I'm leaving.

30:01.915 --> 30:03.755
Come and play for a while.

30:05.484 --> 30:05.875
Leader.

30:05.875 --> 30:06.724
It's hot.

30:06.724 --> 30:08.984
Your dough is fermented too well.

30:10.154 --> 30:10.694
Of course.

30:10.694 --> 30:11.285
Let me do it.

30:11.285 --> 30:13.804
If you don't sell buns,
it's a pity, you know?

30:13.804 --> 30:14.524
Come on.

30:14.524 --> 30:15.764
Hongdou.

30:15.764 --> 30:16.524
Hongdou.

30:16.524 --> 30:17.804
Okay.

30:18.284 --> 30:18.804
Come on.

30:18.804 --> 30:20.874
Look, freshly steamed buns.

30:20.874 --> 30:22.606
Send them to Li Yulin.

30:23.354 --> 30:24.354
Okay.

30:24.354 --> 30:25.634
Okay?

30:25.634 --> 30:27.914
She gives us pumpkins and native eggs.

30:27.914 --> 30:30.634
Besides, you need to talk
and play with your classmates.

30:30.634 --> 30:33.570
Don't always take a
phone at home, endlessly.

30:33.594 --> 30:35.494
Here, there is another box.

30:35.724 --> 30:38.494
Daughter, as the lobby
manager of the hotel,

30:38.494 --> 30:40.574
are you afraid to meet people?

30:41.114 --> 30:44.034
I'm the vice president of the room division.

30:46.224 --> 30:47.045
Did you hear that?

30:47.045 --> 30:48.444
Vice president of room division.

30:48.444 --> 30:50.764
- Vice President.
- I'm her father.

31:01.484 --> 31:03.744
It takes you so long to get back.

31:04.724 --> 31:06.154
Their house is too noisy.

31:06.154 --> 31:09.170
I went with her to the
roof to absorb the aerosol.

31:09.524 --> 31:12.170
She sold insurance for you again, right?

31:12.194 --> 31:15.984
It's not easy to do part-time
jobs at home with the kids.

31:15.984 --> 31:17.564
Don't buy it if you don't want to.

31:17.564 --> 31:18.844
It's okay.

31:19.004 --> 31:24.153
As old classmates, how
snobbish it is to sell things.

31:24.154 --> 31:25.724
Don't say that.

31:25.724 --> 31:28.634
In the small place, we need
to rely on relationships, right?

31:28.634 --> 31:33.084
Besides, insurance is usually bought
from acquaintances and friends.

31:33.084 --> 31:35.084
Isn't taking advantage of acquaintances?

31:35.084 --> 31:36.930
What do you mean by that?

31:36.954 --> 31:39.850
Regular insurance can
be bought from anyone.

31:39.874 --> 31:41.154
I bought it.

31:42.804 --> 31:44.284
What did you buy?

31:45.564 --> 31:47.332
Dad's car insurance.

31:47.844 --> 31:50.634
Your father's car insurance was
bought from your aunt's nephew's

31:50.634 --> 31:52.402
second aunt.

31:52.724 --> 31:55.564
In the future, buy it from Li Yulin.

31:55.564 --> 31:56.594
Why?

31:56.594 --> 31:57.914
Because we're old classmates.

31:57.914 --> 31:59.674
We're very close.

31:59.674 --> 32:00.954
Mom is right.

32:00.954 --> 32:02.434
The insurance should

32:02.524 --> 32:04.194
be bought from formal people.

32:04.194 --> 32:05.874
We can buy it from anyone, right?

32:05.874 --> 32:07.004
Yes.

32:07.004 --> 32:08.004
Dou.

32:08.004 --> 32:11.268
Tell me, how can I explain to your aunt?

32:11.284 --> 32:12.584
I'll talk to her.

32:16.394 --> 32:16.805
No.

32:16.805 --> 32:18.194
You could have at least asked me.

32:18.194 --> 32:21.114
You could have called
me and asked me, right?

32:21.114 --> 32:24.622
All-inclusive customized company tour.

32:24.844 --> 32:26.124
How many people?

32:26.564 --> 32:28.236
More than 20.

32:29.364 --> 32:31.084
The number of people is not a problem.

32:31.084 --> 32:33.764
We have never received such a reception.

32:33.844 --> 32:35.954
But the price is very good.

32:35.954 --> 32:38.004
Book in advance for the homestay in town.

32:38.004 --> 32:40.434
Three nights, which can be filled up with

32:40.434 --> 32:42.284
the activities in our village.

32:42.284 --> 32:44.292
Who gave you the business?

32:44.354 --> 32:45.294
It's a coincidence.

32:45.294 --> 32:47.544
Several days ago, when I
was shopping with my mom,

32:47.544 --> 32:51.004
I met a girl from high school
who was sitting behind me.

32:51.004 --> 32:55.220
Then we talked and found out that
we live in the same neighborhood.

32:55.244 --> 32:56.724
Female classmate?

32:57.114 --> 32:58.714
Yes, female classmate.

33:02.004 --> 33:05.244
After chatting, I found
that she is quite awesome.

33:05.244 --> 33:10.874
She sells eggs, native chicken,
peanut oil, and insurance on WeChat.

33:10.874 --> 33:13.634
Companies have staff
benefits at the end of the year.

33:13.634 --> 33:17.044
She went one by one to
ask if they want to buy things.

33:17.044 --> 33:19.004
She earns more than working.

33:19.114 --> 33:20.284
Okay.

33:20.284 --> 33:22.784
Thank you for thinking of us so much.

33:23.154 --> 33:25.194
Then I'll think about it first.

33:25.194 --> 33:27.094
I'll give you a plan later.

33:28.054 --> 33:30.330
You want to think about it with me?

33:30.354 --> 33:32.554
No, I have to stay up all night.

33:32.874 --> 33:34.270
You don't have to.

33:35.524 --> 33:36.804
Okay.

33:36.804 --> 33:39.064
See you on the line at 10:00 p.m.

33:39.524 --> 33:40.804
Okay.

33:40.914 --> 33:42.194
I'm hanging up.

33:44.674 --> 33:47.724
You're laughing so hard that
your mouth grins behind your ears.

33:47.724 --> 33:49.004
Who is it?

33:49.844 --> 33:51.564
So sticky.

33:51.644 --> 33:53.834
It's called separated
but still together in spirit.

33:53.834 --> 33:54.674
What are you doing?

33:54.674 --> 33:56.434
We're talking about serious business.

33:56.434 --> 33:58.106
You're a prude.

34:00.634 --> 34:02.034
It's your turn.

34:02.034 --> 34:03.418
Hurry up.

34:03.684 --> 34:04.684
Eight dots.

34:04.684 --> 34:06.914
Bump. (Take a tile to complete a set of three.)

34:06.914 --> 34:09.283
Brother, you're short on cards.

34:10.724 --> 34:12.264
Didn't I draw a card?

34:14.164 --> 34:18.572
So love sometimes makes people crazy.

34:20.204 --> 34:22.044
You want to make a dragon?

34:22.764 --> 34:23.874
You guys play.

34:23.874 --> 34:24.874
Okay, I'll do it.

34:24.874 --> 34:25.264
Come on.

34:25.264 --> 34:26.544
Granny.

34:39.644 --> 34:41.064
What are you doing?

34:42.844 --> 34:43.345
What's up?

34:43.345 --> 34:44.644
She's on the phone.

34:44.644 --> 34:46.660
Then you're listening?

34:46.684 --> 34:47.914
Yes.

34:47.914 --> 34:50.724
We Chinese have a passion
for growing vegetables.

34:50.724 --> 34:53.435
Last time when Xu Hongmi
was there, we picked it

34:53.435 --> 34:54.914
and made it into lunch.

34:54.914 --> 34:56.586
It was fun.

34:56.804 --> 34:59.364
The ingredients are fresh and healthy.

35:01.724 --> 35:03.004
Like...

35:05.554 --> 35:06.604
Good.

35:06.604 --> 35:07.884
This is good.

35:10.034 --> 35:11.634
What is she busy with?

35:11.954 --> 35:14.554
She's back, but her
heart is still out there.

35:14.554 --> 35:15.434
What do you mean?

35:15.434 --> 35:17.694
Why is her heart still out there?

35:17.854 --> 35:20.144
You're an old man, I can't
make sense of it with you.

35:20.144 --> 35:20.834
Go back to bed.

35:20.834 --> 35:22.124
Go.

35:22.124 --> 35:23.404
Come back.

35:23.844 --> 35:25.124
Take a bath.

35:25.124 --> 35:27.204
Didn't we agree to two days...

35:28.954 --> 35:30.354
Okay.

35:30.354 --> 35:32.422
Take a bath.

35:37.284 --> 35:38.564
Go on.

36:04.914 --> 36:06.034
Oil.

36:06.034 --> 36:06.724
Quickly put.

36:06.724 --> 36:07.874
Just put?

36:07.874 --> 36:09.654
The oil is hot, hurry up.

36:11.074 --> 36:12.164
Really?

36:12.164 --> 36:13.554
Don't run away, come here.

36:13.554 --> 36:14.834
Fry.

36:14.994 --> 36:15.994
Fry it.

36:15.994 --> 36:17.204
The oil spills out.

36:17.204 --> 36:19.488
Of course.

36:20.034 --> 36:21.604
Then... How to do with it?

36:21.604 --> 36:23.124
Just be burned.

36:23.124 --> 36:25.072
But it hurts.

36:25.474 --> 36:27.002
Are you not afraid?

36:27.034 --> 36:28.466
Won't it hurt?

36:29.284 --> 36:30.644
Add the soy sauce.

36:30.804 --> 36:32.524
- Soy sauce.
- Soy sauce.

36:33.284 --> 36:34.204
Where are you going?

36:34.204 --> 36:35.484
That one.

36:36.034 --> 36:37.314
This one?

36:37.994 --> 36:39.274
Soy sauce.

36:42.724 --> 36:43.474
Enough.

36:43.474 --> 36:45.554
It is enough to fry two meals.

36:47.204 --> 36:49.354
What's the use of having a man?

36:49.354 --> 36:50.204
Xiaochun is here.

36:50.204 --> 36:51.484
Manjun,

36:51.554 --> 36:53.284
you... have you eaten?

36:53.284 --> 36:54.244
I've eaten.

36:54.244 --> 36:55.524
It smells good.

36:55.724 --> 36:57.394
Are you here to see Huang?

36:57.394 --> 36:59.174
No, I'm here for you.

36:59.204 --> 36:59.874
Why?

36:59.874 --> 37:00.354
Stop.

37:00.354 --> 37:01.634
Give it to me.

37:02.284 --> 37:04.484
Be careful, don't burn yourself.

37:06.394 --> 37:07.814
What are you doing?

37:08.124 --> 37:09.404
Well,

37:09.684 --> 37:13.353
I heard that the kindergarten
is having a party recently.

37:13.354 --> 37:18.098
You're volunteering to help Hulu's
class rehearse the chorus, right?

37:18.684 --> 37:22.644
Can you put Hulu in the middle
and let her be the lead singer?

37:22.644 --> 37:25.244
Hulu is too tall to stand in the middle.

37:25.244 --> 37:27.434
Why?

37:27.434 --> 37:27.705
Look.

37:27.705 --> 37:29.804
The middle one is high,
and the other children

37:29.804 --> 37:32.554
are as low as the roof.

37:32.554 --> 37:33.614
Isn't that pretty?

37:33.614 --> 37:34.474
It's not pretty.

37:34.474 --> 37:35.724
Why?

37:35.724 --> 37:37.564
Manjun, what do you think?

37:38.804 --> 37:39.994
I think it's fine.

37:39.994 --> 37:40.764
Look.

37:40.764 --> 37:42.394
I'm right.

37:42.394 --> 37:47.163
But, the lead singer should
be the best singer, right?

37:47.164 --> 37:50.034
Otherwise, other children
will not be convinced,

37:50.034 --> 37:53.124
and it will be hard for her
to stay in the kindergarten.

37:53.124 --> 37:55.996
Is your Hulu good at singing?

38:00.354 --> 38:03.010
♫ Draw birds ♫

38:03.034 --> 38:05.724
♫ flying in the sky ♫

38:05.724 --> 38:08.204
♫ Draw grass ♫

38:08.204 --> 38:10.844
♫ growing in the spring ♫

38:10.844 --> 38:13.554
♫ You draw sun ♫

38:13.554 --> 38:16.220
♫ I draw the national flag ♫

38:16.244 --> 38:18.954
♫ Motherland, motherland ♫

38:18.954 --> 38:21.838
♫ We love you ♫

38:24.644 --> 38:25.924
Good.

38:26.074 --> 38:28.244
You can sing it completely.

38:28.244 --> 38:30.661
But look, I will sing it for you.

38:31.124 --> 38:33.724
♫ Draw birds ♫

38:33.724 --> 38:36.330
♫ flying in the sky ♫

38:36.354 --> 38:38.850
♫ Draw grass ♫

38:38.874 --> 38:40.684
♫ growing in the spring ♫

38:40.684 --> 38:41.724
Sing.

38:41.724 --> 38:44.394
♫ Draw birds ♫

38:44.394 --> 38:47.050
♫ flying in the sky ♫

38:47.074 --> 38:49.604
♫ Draw grass ♫

38:49.604 --> 38:51.874
♫ growing in the spring ♫

38:51.874 --> 38:52.874
Stop.

38:52.874 --> 38:54.154
Not bad.

38:54.514 --> 38:56.874
Just be more emotional.

38:56.874 --> 38:58.074
Look.

38:58.074 --> 39:00.554
♫ Draw birds ♫

39:00.554 --> 39:01.514
Sing.

39:01.514 --> 39:04.674
♫ Draw birds ♫

39:07.034 --> 39:09.390
Mom, are you crying?

39:10.204 --> 39:13.370
Mom, are you angry?

39:13.394 --> 39:14.164
No.

39:14.164 --> 39:17.140
I have a headache.

39:17.164 --> 39:20.468
Mom, are you sick?

39:28.884 --> 39:31.744
[What to prepare before
opening a homestay?]

39:37.724 --> 39:39.684
Qiu, are you busy?

39:39.724 --> 39:41.684
I have something to consult you.

39:41.684 --> 39:43.704
Is it convenient to call you?

39:49.164 --> 39:51.788
Hello, Qiu, are you busy?

39:52.994 --> 39:55.875
I don't understand some of
the suggestions you gave me

39:55.875 --> 39:57.514
about homestay last time.

39:57.514 --> 39:59.054
So I want to ask you.

40:00.994 --> 40:01.644
Okay.

40:01.644 --> 40:07.124
Then let me tell you some
details about the homestay.

40:07.124 --> 40:08.748
Please help me judge.

40:13.604 --> 40:14.994
The dark soy sauce is used up.

40:14.994 --> 40:16.294
There's no more for tomorrow.

40:16.294 --> 40:16.764
Dou.

40:16.764 --> 40:18.034
Dou.

40:18.034 --> 40:19.284
Don't call her.

40:19.284 --> 40:20.644
I'll go buy it.

40:20.644 --> 40:24.034
She is busy on the phone,
calling men and women.

40:24.034 --> 40:25.780
She's busy with business.

40:25.804 --> 40:28.184
You eavesdropped on her again.

40:28.954 --> 40:30.874
No, she has to go.

40:30.874 --> 40:32.554
She hasn't moved for a day.

40:32.554 --> 40:33.125
Hurry up.

40:33.125 --> 40:35.228
Let her go. Hurry up.

40:35.554 --> 40:36.834
Dou.

40:39.514 --> 40:40.994
I'm shopping.

40:41.434 --> 40:43.994
My mom asked me to buy dark soy sauce.

40:47.994 --> 40:49.954
I want to ask you something.

40:49.994 --> 40:52.734
What is the lowest price for
the transfer of the homestay

40:52.734 --> 40:54.058
in the village?

40:55.554 --> 40:58.284
The lowest price for the rent
and transfer fees together.

40:58.284 --> 40:59.434
My friend asked me to ask about it.

40:59.434 --> 41:00.634
Please ask about it for me.

41:00.634 --> 41:04.304
It's not appropriate to
ask the price directly.

41:04.304 --> 41:05.414
Doesn't she take a look?

41:05.414 --> 41:07.514
I've seen it all, and sent photos to her.

41:07.514 --> 41:10.014
She just wants to know more about it.

41:10.434 --> 41:12.118
Please ask it for me.

41:12.554 --> 41:13.434
Okay.

41:13.434 --> 41:15.394
I'll tell you when I'm done.

41:15.764 --> 41:16.604
Okay.

41:16.604 --> 41:17.514
Go to work.

41:17.514 --> 41:18.794
I'm hanging up.

41:19.804 --> 41:21.284
Talk with me for a while.

41:21.284 --> 41:23.940
You're so purposeful on the phone.

41:23.964 --> 41:26.104
What do you want to talk about?

41:26.154 --> 41:27.874
When will you go back to Beijing?

41:27.874 --> 41:29.474
I haven't decided yet.

41:30.914 --> 41:34.180
Is the job undecided, or the
time to go back undecided?

41:34.204 --> 41:35.044
Neither.

41:35.044 --> 41:37.244
Let's talk about something else.

41:38.394 --> 41:39.826
How's your ulcer?

41:40.584 --> 41:44.740
You should take more
vitamin B and stay up less.

41:44.764 --> 41:46.044
I know.

41:46.434 --> 41:51.074
But when people focus on
something, they will be worried, fearful,

41:51.074 --> 41:53.164
anxious, and internal friction.

41:53.164 --> 41:57.010
I think there will be a
good result this time.

41:57.034 --> 41:58.314
You think?

41:59.124 --> 42:01.504
Women's intuition is very accurate.

42:02.644 --> 42:04.316
Women's intuition.

42:04.644 --> 42:05.684
Okay.

42:05.684 --> 42:06.944
I trust you.

42:06.944 --> 42:09.394
When there is good
news, I will tell you first.

42:09.394 --> 42:10.394
Okay.

42:10.394 --> 42:11.905
Bye. I'm going shopping.

42:18.314 --> 42:24.822
♫ Listen to the rain
falling into the silent forest ♫

42:25.754 --> 42:31.638
♫ Enjoy the mountainous landscape at sunset ♫

42:33.164 --> 42:39.533
♫ The raindrops on the roof
fall into the eyes secretly ♫

42:39.534 --> 42:45.934
♫ The world is like a quiet island ♫

42:47.874 --> 42:54.286
♫ The sky is turning bright silently ♫

42:55.244 --> 43:01.020
♫ Waiting for the seabirds
to call forth the ripples ♫

43:02.674 --> 43:09.203
♫ Waiting for the sunlight to shine into
my heart across the lake ♫

43:09.204 --> 43:16.576
♫ Set sail when it's windy ♫

43:17.484 --> 43:23.924
♫ The reflection of clouds, the changing moon
and the stars all over the sky ♫

43:23.924 --> 43:31.924
♫ The lost footsteps will be gradually erased ♫

43:32.054 --> 43:34.104
♫ The light and shadow of four seasons ♫

43:34.104 --> 43:38.733
♫ I've seen the meteor
that lights up the night sky ♫

43:38.734 --> 43:47.074
♫ When the wind rises,
the sky will be cloudless ♫

43:50.744 --> 43:56.880
♫ The sky is turning bright silently ♫

43:58.074 --> 44:04.450
♫ Waiting for the seabirds
to call forth the ripples ♫

44:05.464 --> 44:11.884
♫ Waiting for the sunlight to shine into
my heart across the lake ♫

44:11.884 --> 44:19.884
♫ Set sail when it's windy ♫

44:20.244 --> 44:26.694
♫ The reflection of clouds, the changing moon
and the stars all over the sky ♫

44:26.694 --> 44:34.698
♫ The lost footsteps will be gradually erased ♫

44:34.904 --> 44:36.884
♫ The light and shadow of four seasons ♫

44:36.884 --> 44:41.484
♫ I've seen the meteor
that lights up the night sky ♫

44:41.484 --> 44:48.843
♫ When the wind rises,
the sky will be cloudless ♫

44:48.844 --> 44:56.860
♫ Go to a windy place to meet you ♫
